ingle can of diced tomatoes with a dent along the upper edge of the can which was significant enough to make the integrity of the can questionable. The can was date marked and not separated from other cans. Ensure that cans which are damaged are rejected upon delivery to the facility and not allowed to be stocked in. Discuss with warehouse to ensure that cans are being delivered in good, safe condition. Cans that are discovere post-delivery to have dents must be separated and marked in a manner indicating they must not be used. Cans were separated immediately. Corrected on site. No follow-up required.\n\n3-202.15: FOOD packages shall be in good condition and protect the integrity of the contents so that the FOOD is not exposed to ADULTERATION or potential contaminants.","citation":"","citation_text":""}]},{"id":"431637","date":"2022-09-21","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No violations found","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=23911&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=431637&INSPECTION_NN=431637","older":false,"fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"407683","date":"2022-01-27","visit":"Spot check","type_raw":"Spot Check","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No violations found","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=23911&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=407683&INSPECTION_NN=407683","older":false,"fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"407366","date":"2022-01-24","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":2,"label":"Minor issues","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=23911&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=407366&INSPECTION_NN=407366","older":false,"fetched":true,"findings":[{"item":48,"title":"Warewashing facilities: installed, maintained, & used; test strips","repeat":false,"comment":"","citation":"4-302.14","citation_text":"4-302.14 Quat test strips available for use were water damaged. Manager will get a new set of test strips from the district office. \nA test kit that accurately measures the concentration of sanitizing solutions in mg/L shall be provided."},{"item":48,"title":"Warewashing facilities: installed, maintained, & used; test strips","repeat":false,"comment":"","citation":"4-501.15","citation_text":"4-501.15 Digital readout for final rinse temperature at the dish machine was not consistently displaying the temperature. After ~5 cycles it was at 177F but then stopped showing the final rinse temperature during the next few cycles. When the display registered a temperature again it showed a final rinse temperature at the manifold of 169F, but the surface temperature was observed at 160F with inspector’s dish temp tester. Manager will call for service to get the machine checked. \nA warewashing machine and its auxiliary components shall be operated in accordance with the machine's data plate and other manufacturer's instructions."}]},{"id":"400882","date":"2021-11-03","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No violations found","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=23911&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=400882&INSPECTION_NN=400882","older":false,"fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"390572","date":"2021-02-04","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No violations found","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=23911&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=390572&INSPECTION_NN=390572","older":false,"fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"376328","date":"2020-12-18","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No violations found","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/I